// ============================================================================
// Interactions at the tree's edge (Chapter 2): one knot per interactable in
// src/data/areas/borderland/treesEdge.ts. Draft text for the designer to rewrite.
// ============================================================================

=== trees_edge_warning ===
A scavengers' sign: the tree, struck through. Nobody goes closer than this.
-> END

=== trees_edge_roots ===
The bark is wet, and warmer than it should be.
-> END

=== trees_edge_listen ===
Something in the wood creaks and settles. Then again, further up.
As if the whole thing is breathing.
-> END

=== trees_edge_crack ===
A crack between two roots, glowing green at its edges, black inside.
Too narrow to get into. Something cold comes out of it.
-> END
